  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.8\n        - G9SelectionSheet (behind G9ComboBox and G9Picker) no longer builds one row per item: the first RowPageSize (60) matches, the next page on a scroll to the end, at most MaxRenderedRows (200), and a «N more — search to narrow the list» footer (G9StringKey.MoreResultsFormat, new) for the rest. Selected items beyond the window stay listed. The loading skeleton is capped at the rows a sheet can show. A 3,416-person list used to take 36,733 Android global references at once and was killed as an ANR.\n\n        Earlier versions: https://github.com/ImanKari/G9MAUIControls/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
